---
import { SOCIALS } from "@/constants";
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="pod-footer">
  <div class="pod-wrap">
    <div class="pod-footer-main">
      <div>
        <a class="pod-footer-title" href="/">轻松愉快<span>✳</span></a><p>
          一些闲聊，一点共鸣。<br />和朋友们一起，认真地轻松一下。
        </p>
      </div><div class="pod-footer-links">
        <span class="pod-kicker">在别处，也能听见我们</span><div>
          {
            SOCIALS.filter(s => s.name !== "Mail").map(s => (
              <a href={s.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
                {s.name} ↗
              </a>
            ))
          }
        </div><a href="mailto:amerlca@163.com">写信给我们 ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div><div class="pod-footer-bottom">
      <span>© {year} 轻松愉快</span><a href="https://chaoanli.com/"
        >Chaoan 的个人主页 ↗</a
      ><a href="https://feed.xyzfm.space/6vnv3ae7g34t">RSS 订阅 ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
